While rampaging, you slam up to [2, 3, 3, 4, 4 (TL1-5)] adjacent opponents, stunning them for 2 turns and damaging them for between [41, 56, 67, 76, 85 (TL1-5; PP 100)] and [83, 112, 134, 153, 170 (TL1-5; PP 100)] physical damage. Your first slam of at least two opponents increases the rampage duration by 1.

Damage increases with your Physical Power.
